WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.850
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.120 --> 00:06.600
Tomorrow's a day off.

3
00:06.600 --> 00:08.200
You have to keep me company.

4
00:08.400 --> 00:09.360
Hello, Mom.

5
00:09.360 --> 00:10.880
I have something to take care of at the college.

6
00:10.920 --> 00:12.840
I won't be able to come home for a few days.

7
00:12.880 --> 00:14.440
Usually, Ing doesn't take anyone under his wing.

8
00:14.480 --> 00:16.320
That means you must be pretty special.

9
00:17.120 --> 00:18.800
Don't tell your friends about us again.

10
00:19.040 --> 00:20.720
You're acting all disgusted.

11
00:20.720 --> 00:22.120
Do I look that disgusting?

12
00:22.240 --> 00:23.000
P'Ing,

13
00:24.160 --> 00:25.440
do we have to talk about it now?

14
00:25.480 --> 00:26.400
Someone might see us.

15
00:26.440 --> 00:28.280
I'm a straightforward guy.

16
00:28.280 --> 00:29.280
And let me tell you this,

17
00:29.280 --> 00:30.480
it won't be long before I make you

18
00:30.520 --> 00:31.800
want to be mine.

19
01:36.880 --> 01:37.520
So,

20
01:39.680 --> 01:40.759
whatever it is, just say it.

21
01:48.920 --> 01:51.000
You know that we can't go public,

22
01:51.320 --> 01:52.520
but you did that today

23
01:52.640 --> 01:54.400
while P'Phet and Itt were right there.

24
01:57.840 --> 01:58.960
Thought it was something serious.

25
02:00.320 --> 02:01.080
Is that all it is?

26
02:04.520 --> 02:05.240
Why?

27
02:06.320 --> 02:07.080
Are you scared?

28
02:09.240 --> 02:10.320
If people find out,

29
02:10.320 --> 02:11.840
it won't be a laughing matter.

30
02:12.440 --> 02:14.840
Can you stop talking and acting so recklessly?

31
02:15.320 --> 02:17.040
But I've already done it, haven't I?

32
02:17.040 --> 02:18.840
And I can't turn back time.

33
02:18.840 --> 02:20.960
Yok, it's a holiday today.

34
02:21.120 --> 02:22.320
Shouldn't we be happy

35
02:22.360 --> 02:23.920
instead of standing here fighting?

36
02:23.960 --> 02:25.440
And all over such a trivial little thing.

37
02:31.480 --> 02:32.680
I don't think this is trivial.

38
02:32.720 --> 02:34.240
But it's not a big deal, either.

39
02:39.240 --> 02:39.880
Yok.

40
02:40.600 --> 02:41.320
Yok.

41
02:42.880 --> 02:43.480
Hey.

42
02:44.240 --> 02:44.960
What is it?

43
02:46.480 --> 02:47.640
Do I have to beg for your forgiveness

44
02:47.680 --> 02:48.960
for us to talk nicely?

45
02:51.400 --> 02:52.880
Have you ever thought about me?

46
02:53.600 --> 02:55.480
My life doesn't just belong to me.

47
02:56.480 --> 02:57.320
You can do whatever you want,

48
02:57.360 --> 02:58.760
but I can't.

49
03:00.760 --> 03:02.280
You don't know anything

50
03:03.800 --> 03:04.880
about us or my training.

51
03:12.680 --> 03:13.200
Yok.

52
03:20.160 --> 03:21.079
I'm sorry.

53
03:22.840 --> 03:24.400
I'm sorry. I didn't realize...

54
03:25.200 --> 03:26.680
how much pressure you're under.

55
03:29.240 --> 03:30.480
I won't do this ever again.

56
03:32.800 --> 03:33.480
Okay?

57
03:34.120 --> 03:36.520
Just calm down. Please.

58
03:38.160 --> 03:38.640
Come here.

59
03:39.079 --> 03:39.640
Look.

60
03:40.320 --> 03:41.360
Aren't you hot?

61
03:41.600 --> 03:42.560
Let me take your jacket off.

62
03:42.600 --> 03:43.240
I'm fine.

63
03:43.840 --> 03:44.600
Yok.

64
03:46.440 --> 03:48.160
Do you think I'm just being irrational?

65
03:52.200 --> 03:54.040
You could always find an excuse.

66
03:54.960 --> 03:56.560
But at the end of the day,

67
03:57.760 --> 03:59.240
you always win.

68
04:01.240 --> 04:02.600
It's your fault for being so cute

69
04:02.600 --> 04:04.120
and making me such a sucker for you.

70
04:04.360 --> 04:05.600
You know that, don't you?

71
04:08.160 --> 04:08.880
Look.

72
04:10.720 --> 04:13.160
We haven't seen each other for days.

73
04:15.400 --> 04:17.120
Don't you miss me at all?

74
04:20.040 --> 04:21.839
I've been missing you so badly.

75
04:24.960 --> 04:26.200
I'm sorry.

76
04:26.240 --> 04:28.120
I took the teasing too far today.

77
04:28.160 --> 04:28.920
But do you know why?

78
04:28.960 --> 04:30.040
It's because I missed you.

79
04:30.080 --> 04:32.600
We haven't talked to or seen each other in days.

80
04:33.200 --> 04:34.159
I missed you.

81
04:48.760 --> 04:49.720
I have to go now.

82
04:50.120 --> 04:50.840
Wait.

83
04:52.840 --> 04:53.960
Do you really have to go?

84
04:59.920 --> 05:00.720
Yok.

85
05:01.160 --> 05:02.920
I'm hungry. Make me something.

86
05:04.440 --> 05:05.720
Just order something.

87
05:06.120 --> 05:07.080
I have to go.

88
05:09.880 --> 05:10.800
Yok.

89
05:24.920 --> 05:25.680
Why?

90
05:30.920 --> 05:33.840
You weren't like this before, Yok.

91
05:34.280 --> 05:35.120
What did I do wrong

92
05:35.159 --> 05:36.360
to make you change so much?

93
05:39.840 --> 05:41.400
Can't you just make me this one meal?

94
06:14.040 --> 06:14.840
I'm leaving.

95
06:26.680 --> 06:28.200
Why are you being so cold?

96
06:31.080 --> 06:32.640
You're being so freaking cold.

97
06:46.040 --> 06:47.280
Let's just end things here.

98
07:02.680 --> 07:03.480
Yok.

99
07:15.840 --> 07:17.160
You have no right to say that.

100
07:26.200 --> 07:31.240
♪ I left my deepest scars upon your heart ♪

101
07:31.400 --> 07:36.840
♪ Turned your bright world into darken dark ♪

102
07:37.000 --> 07:41.600
♪ Now it's breaking me apart ♪

103
07:41.880 --> 07:49.080
♪ It's my fault for every broken part we had ♪

104
07:51.880 --> 07:57.040
♪ Time slipping, we're not getting younger ♪

105
07:57.080 --> 08:02.480
♪ We tried our best, yet I destroy the glow ♪

106
08:02.520 --> 08:06.800
♪ I made it harder to hold on ♪

107
08:07.280 --> 08:12.200
♪ All the regret keeps going on and on ♪

108
08:12.240 --> 08:17.560
♪ I know what I have done wrong ♪

109
08:17.560 --> 08:23.240
♪ Why did I push you away? ♪

110
08:24.160 --> 08:33.240
♪ It's too late to save us now ♪

111
08:33.280 --> 08:38.640
♪ I hate that I hurt you this way ♪

112
08:38.640 --> 08:43.919
♪ The pain gets heavier every day ♪

113
08:43.960 --> 08:49.440
♪ I'm losing you ♪

114
08:49.480 --> 08:52.800
♪ Again and again ♪

115
08:52.840 --> 08:58.480
♪ I know what I have done wrong ♪

116
11:18.640 --> 11:19.520
Is it too tight?

117
11:22.640 --> 11:23.880
Maybe sometimes,

118
11:24.000 --> 11:25.160
you're just making things

119
11:25.200 --> 11:26.560
more complicated than they need to be.

120
11:30.000 --> 11:31.960
If you ever need to let it all out,

121
11:33.720 --> 11:35.040
I'm right here for you.

122
11:43.360 --> 11:44.640
Let's just end things here.

123
11:46.080 --> 11:47.520
You have no right to say that.

124
12:04.720 --> 12:05.720
Yes, Dad?

125
12:05.720 --> 12:06.920
Where are you?

126
12:08.800 --> 12:10.560
-Well... -No matter where you are,

127
12:10.680 --> 12:11.920
get home right now.

128
12:50.840 --> 12:51.360
[My Capy]

129
12:51.360 --> 12:52.360
[You have no right.]

130
12:52.400 --> 12:53.080
[You're cruel and selfish.]

131
12:53.120 --> 12:53.760
[Did you just see me]

132
12:53.800 --> 12:55.000
[as someone to sleep with?]

133
12:58.800 --> 13:00.400
This will be...

134
13:00.400 --> 13:02.840
the first building you'll oversee for this project.

135
13:06.840 --> 13:07.920
Aren't you going to set foot

136
13:07.960 --> 13:09.760
on the site you'll be managing?

137
13:18.560 --> 13:20.240
สูบบุหรี่มันไม่ดีนะครับ

138
13:34.360 --> 13:36.960
I'd really like to thank you, Mr. Jomphol

139
13:37.400 --> 13:39.720
and Jane, for honoring us

140
13:40.040 --> 13:41.680
by joining my family

141
13:41.680 --> 13:43.440
for this meal today.

142
13:43.480 --> 13:44.840
The pleasure is all mine.

143
13:44.840 --> 13:46.800
This is wonderful.

144
13:46.840 --> 13:47.920
You're very welcome.

145
13:47.960 --> 13:48.880
Thank you so much.

146
13:48.880 --> 13:49.560
[Just finished eating at Grandpa's.]

147
13:49.560 --> 13:50.200
[He's being much nicer to me.]

148
13:50.520 --> 13:52.920
Jane, do you enjoy playing any sports?

149
13:53.560 --> 13:55.720
[Happy for you.]

150
13:56.160 --> 13:58.520
Yok is actually quite talented in many areas.

151
13:58.560 --> 14:00.960
He's good at boxing, basketball...

152
14:00.960 --> 14:03.240
Maybe it'd be nice if you could go golfing together

153
14:03.280 --> 14:04.080
sometime.

154
14:05.280 --> 14:06.760
I prefer going with my friends.

155
14:12.440 --> 14:13.200
[Grandpa was praising you, too.]

156
14:13.200 --> 14:15.040
-[Said he's very impressed with you.] -[Really?]

157
14:16.680 --> 14:18.200
Are you done with your phone yet?

158
14:18.560 --> 14:19.840
Are you talking to me, too?

159
14:22.160 --> 14:23.040
Not at all, dear.

160
14:23.080 --> 14:24.800
You're our guest. Please make yourself at home.

161
14:28.080 --> 14:29.160
Jane...

162
14:30.080 --> 14:31.280
Right.

163
14:31.760 --> 14:33.520
I heard from your dad

164
14:33.560 --> 14:35.960
that you're studying and interning at the same time.

165
14:36.000 --> 14:36.560
That's right.

166
14:36.800 --> 14:38.160
I'm interning at Araya Group.

167
14:39.280 --> 14:40.720
Araya Group?

168
14:41.680 --> 14:44.160
Tiwakorn Adularaya

169
14:44.160 --> 14:46.160
or Ing, CEO of Araya Group,

170
14:46.600 --> 14:49.120
is one of the most brilliant people I've ever met.

171
14:49.160 --> 14:50.080
Indeed.

172
14:50.120 --> 14:51.920
He's taught me a great deal.

173
14:57.600 --> 14:58.600
That's good to hear.

174
14:59.040 --> 15:01.440
Maybe I should have Jane

175
15:01.840 --> 15:03.320
intern there as well.

176
15:04.800 --> 15:06.040
Enough, Dad.

177
15:06.600 --> 15:08.400
Isn't this already awkward enough?

178
15:09.320 --> 15:11.160
If all I have to do is have a meal with them

179
15:11.280 --> 15:13.840
for your sake, that's fine.

180
15:14.400 --> 15:16.840
But setting me up with him?

181
15:17.280 --> 15:18.440
That's where I draw the line.

182
15:24.040 --> 15:25.200
Jane,

183
15:25.240 --> 15:26.680
do it for my sake.

184
15:40.520 --> 15:41.520
Thank you.

185
15:42.400 --> 15:44.480
If that's all, I'll take my leave now.

186
15:45.160 --> 15:46.120
Wait.

187
15:51.800 --> 15:55.040
Was that how I taught you to treat guests?

188
15:56.400 --> 15:58.120
Honey, don't be so hard on him.

189
15:58.240 --> 15:59.720
Didn't you see how Jane was acting?

190
16:04.440 --> 16:05.160
Here we go again.

191
16:07.800 --> 16:09.040
Mr. Jomphol's daughter

192
16:09.040 --> 16:10.560
only went abroad once,

193
16:10.600 --> 16:12.560
and she came back a completely different person.

194
16:13.760 --> 16:15.240
If I'd known this would happen,

195
16:15.280 --> 16:17.520
I never would've let you send Yok abroad.

196
16:18.760 --> 16:19.840
That's enough.

197
16:20.720 --> 16:21.800
What did you just say?

198
16:22.680 --> 16:24.160
I said that's enough.

199
16:24.560 --> 16:26.400
Both of you saw and heard everything.

200
16:26.720 --> 16:28.080
Do you still not get

201
16:28.200 --> 16:30.160
just how much Jane wants nothing to do with us?

202
16:34.280 --> 16:34.920
There you go.

203
16:35.440 --> 16:36.720
Your precious son.

204
16:37.800 --> 16:39.120
He's your son, too.

205
16:39.160 --> 16:40.360
We made him together.

206
16:58.720 --> 17:00.240
You called for me, Mr. Ing?

207
17:00.760 --> 17:01.520
Oh.

208
17:02.720 --> 17:04.720
I wanted to ask about Yok's internship.

209
17:04.960 --> 17:06.359
He hasn't shown up in days.

210
17:06.400 --> 17:07.200
He's completely disappeared.

211
17:09.240 --> 17:10.000
I see.

212
17:10.560 --> 17:12.839
It might be due to the overlapping holidays.

213
17:13.920 --> 17:14.960
There might've been some changes.

214
17:15.000 --> 17:16.720
I'll check on it right away.

215
17:19.079 --> 17:20.119
Now get back to work.

216
17:30.560 --> 17:31.160
What's up?

217
17:31.160 --> 17:32.240
Hey, Ing.

218
17:32.240 --> 17:33.800
Let's go for drinks at Zen's place tonight.

219
17:33.840 --> 17:36.040
It's just me, Vince, and a few friends.

220
17:36.080 --> 17:36.720
Count me in.

221
17:37.320 --> 17:38.360
I was getting bored anyway.

222
17:38.760 --> 17:41.200
Oh, please. A busy guy like you...

223
17:41.440 --> 17:42.240
actually has free time?

224
17:42.280 --> 17:43.200
Tell you what.

225
17:43.200 --> 17:45.600
No heading home until you're wasted tonight, okay?

226
17:47.040 --> 17:48.080
Yeah. See you.

227
17:48.080 --> 17:50.040
Yeah, see you.

228
18:03.400 --> 18:04.200
Hey,

229
18:05.200 --> 18:06.560
you don't look like you're having fun.

230
18:06.840 --> 18:07.760
Is something up?

231
18:08.520 --> 18:09.560
I'm just tired.

232
18:14.520 --> 18:15.440
Hey, Vince.

233
18:15.600 --> 18:16.440
Come here for a sec.

234
18:18.600 --> 18:20.920
Can you find a few guys

235
18:20.920 --> 18:22.640
to entertain Mr. Ing here?

236
18:22.960 --> 18:23.680
Well,

237
18:23.920 --> 18:25.320
I actually have someone in mind.

238
18:26.280 --> 18:28.400
Ing, remember Junior?

239
18:28.960 --> 18:29.800
Junior?

240
18:31.120 --> 18:31.880
Who's that?

241
18:33.400 --> 18:35.640
The one you met at my barber shop.

242
18:35.720 --> 18:36.520
Oh.

243
18:37.080 --> 18:38.960
He's a bit short on cash right now.

244
18:39.560 --> 18:41.800
He's looking for a benefactor. Interested?

245
18:45.320 --> 18:45.960
Okay.

246
18:46.840 --> 18:47.720
Call him over.

247
18:47.920 --> 18:48.800
I thought...

248
18:48.800 --> 18:51.200
you were into guys like Pipi.

249
18:51.600 --> 18:52.560
Have you changed your type

250
18:52.600 --> 18:54.560
to innocent virgins now?

251
18:55.960 --> 18:58.480
Being a virgin doesn't always mean being innocent.

252
18:59.640 --> 19:00.880
As for Junior,

253
19:01.560 --> 19:02.520
just call him.

254
19:03.080 --> 19:04.480
Same place, same price.

255
19:05.200 --> 19:06.200
Make it tonight.

256
19:07.160 --> 19:07.800
Deal.

257
19:12.880 --> 19:15.200
-Cheers. -Stop stressing and drink up, then.

258
19:28.080 --> 19:28.800
Whoa...

259
19:42.800 --> 19:43.680
Sit here.

260
19:50.600 --> 19:51.320
Come on.

261
19:54.040 --> 19:55.200
I'm sorry, Mr. Ing.

262
20:03.720 --> 20:04.800
To be honest,

263
20:05.280 --> 20:06.320
you...

264
20:07.000 --> 20:08.120
are not cut out for this job.

265
20:11.360 --> 20:12.600
People in this industry

266
20:12.640 --> 20:13.840
will just take advantage of you.

267
20:17.320 --> 20:18.120
How about this?

268
20:20.280 --> 20:21.120
I'll take care of you.

269
20:26.680 --> 20:27.640
Really?

270
20:29.080 --> 20:30.440
With a guy like me,

271
20:31.400 --> 20:32.760
I mean what I say.

272
20:41.200 --> 20:41.760
Here.

273
20:42.680 --> 20:43.920
Quit this job.

274
20:48.560 --> 20:50.000
Use this card for whatever you need.

275
21:01.440 --> 21:02.760
You've got a good face.

276
21:04.440 --> 21:06.000
Stop staring at the floor, okay?

277
21:06.160 --> 21:07.040
Have some confidence.

278
21:09.200 --> 21:10.720
See you around, Junior.

279
21:25.360 --> 21:26.160
Come in.

280
21:36.440 --> 21:38.240
Do you think you're some kind of god?

281
21:38.960 --> 21:40.080
Do I need to summon you

282
21:40.120 --> 21:41.320
just to get you here?

283
21:55.880 --> 21:57.240
Dressed like that...

284
21:57.520 --> 21:58.680
Going to boxing practice after this?

285
22:02.000 --> 22:03.080
Sorry to break it to you.

286
22:03.960 --> 22:05.800
I'm afraid you won't be going anywhere.

287
22:06.760 --> 22:07.720
Excuse me?

288
22:09.680 --> 22:12.080
Today is the day I settle the score with you.

289
22:16.920 --> 22:18.320
Who do you think you are

290
22:18.880 --> 22:20.480
to dump me just like that?

291
22:22.720 --> 22:23.720
P'Ing,

292
22:24.080 --> 22:25.400
we're not a good fit for each other.

293
22:25.840 --> 22:27.120
We'll only have more problems.

294
22:27.320 --> 22:28.920
Oh, we're not a good fit?

295
22:29.240 --> 22:30.680
You've been inside me for half a year,

296
22:30.720 --> 22:31.840
and now you're saying that?

297
22:32.520 --> 22:33.880
The bottom's at a disadvantage,

298
22:33.920 --> 22:34.520
you jerk.

299
22:38.520 --> 22:40.040
What exactly do you want?

300
22:43.040 --> 22:45.240
Oh, it's simple.

301
22:46.320 --> 22:47.440
Just take off your pants

302
22:47.480 --> 22:49.040
and lie face down so I can do my thing.

303
22:51.040 --> 22:51.840
No.

304
22:55.840 --> 22:56.600
Get over here.

305
23:02.320 --> 23:03.080
Come here.

306
23:03.840 --> 23:04.920
Listen to me.

307
23:05.360 --> 23:07.080
If I don't get to be inside you in this life,

308
23:07.120 --> 23:08.240
don't ever call me Ing again.

309
23:08.880 --> 23:09.960
I'm not letting you...

310
23:14.200 --> 23:15.560
Told you. Just give up.

311
23:15.600 --> 23:16.160
Come on.

312
23:19.320 --> 23:21.720
Fine. Get over here.

313
23:25.320 --> 23:26.920
Just be my bottom.

314
23:29.720 --> 23:30.520
Come here.

315
23:34.240 --> 23:36.160
Is ruining my life the only way

316
23:36.160 --> 23:37.080
you'll be satisfied?

317
23:37.080 --> 23:37.880
Yeah.

318
23:38.160 --> 23:39.640
If you've got the guts, just break my arm.

319
23:40.600 --> 23:41.200
[Coach Khun]

320
23:41.240 --> 23:42.160
Damn it, Yok.

321
23:42.160 --> 23:44.040
You said you'd leave me alone.

322
23:44.080 --> 23:45.320
[Coach Khun]

323
23:45.320 --> 23:47.640
My arm's about to break. Damn it.

324
23:56.240 --> 23:57.320
What's wrong with the door?

325
24:02.320 --> 24:03.040
Oh...

326
24:03.440 --> 24:04.640
Looks like the lock broke

327
24:04.680 --> 24:05.640
from that impact just now.

328
24:05.680 --> 24:06.680
[Coach Khun]

329
24:06.720 --> 24:09.200
[Missed call from Coach Khun]

330
24:09.520 --> 24:11.240
You did this yourself. It's not my fault.

331
24:12.240 --> 24:13.240
Actually, that works for me.

332
24:14.120 --> 24:16.320
That way, you'll have to stay with me even longer.

333
24:18.840 --> 24:20.040
I can't stay.

334
24:20.680 --> 24:21.680
I've got a match.

335
24:23.720 --> 24:25.560
And how is that my problem?

336
24:25.560 --> 24:27.280
If you'd just let me do it, this would've been over.

337
24:27.280 --> 24:29.080
It's not my fault, you know.

338
24:30.440 --> 24:31.120
Hey,

339
24:31.480 --> 24:33.120
why don't you just go to hell?

340
24:48.800 --> 24:49.560
Well...

341
24:50.720 --> 24:52.720
I didn't know you had a match today.

342
25:05.880 --> 25:07.960
I'm having a meeting tonight.

343
25:08.440 --> 25:10.440
Secretary Pieng is coming to see me.

344
25:10.920 --> 25:11.880
Just hold on

345
25:21.120 --> 25:24.840
[I'm sorry, Yok.]

346
25:27.200 --> 25:28.080
[I'm sorry, Yok.]

347
25:41.560 --> 25:43.080
[I'm so sorry.]

348
25:48.120 --> 25:49.720
Why should I apologize to him?

349
25:50.400 --> 25:52.280
He's the one who started it.

350
26:05.800 --> 26:07.520
Yes, Director Pha-nu?

351
26:08.800 --> 26:09.720
Mr. Ing,

352
26:09.800 --> 26:11.520
your Mahasamut project,

353
26:11.680 --> 26:13.760
is selling like hotcakes, isn't it?

354
26:14.200 --> 26:15.440
Actually,

355
26:15.440 --> 26:17.320
I have to thank you

356
26:17.440 --> 26:19.040
for helping me out.

357
26:19.520 --> 26:20.960
I called because there's something

358
26:21.320 --> 26:22.840
I want to talk to you about

359
26:23.200 --> 26:24.920
since we're so close.

360
26:25.120 --> 26:27.400
Please don't take offense at what I'm about to say.

361
26:27.960 --> 26:29.240
Let me be frank with you.

362
26:29.440 --> 26:31.960
I only did it 'cause I wanted what was best for you.

363
26:35.520 --> 26:37.440
You can be direct with me.

364
26:38.160 --> 26:40.520
Back when we were processing your project,

365
26:40.680 --> 26:42.480
there were four of us, me and my friends.

366
26:42.480 --> 26:45.160
You promised us one unit each.

367
26:45.400 --> 26:46.720
You remember that?

368
26:48.400 --> 26:49.160
Hold on a second.

369
26:51.200 --> 26:53.440
P'Pha-nu, what exactly happened?

370
26:53.440 --> 26:54.720
I'm not following.

371
26:55.040 --> 26:58.040
You kept your promise to me,

372
26:58.160 --> 26:59.760
but the other three...

373
26:59.800 --> 27:01.600
only received five million in cash.

374
27:01.800 --> 27:03.080
Those condo units...

375
27:03.280 --> 27:05.480
are worth over 20 million each, aren't they?

376
27:06.160 --> 27:07.040
Right now,

377
27:07.080 --> 27:09.440
they're getting pretty upset about this.

378
27:10.600 --> 27:12.560
P'Pha-nu... I mean, Director.

379
27:12.600 --> 27:14.800
I don't understand how this happened.

380
27:14.840 --> 27:16.560
May I look into it first?

381
27:16.800 --> 27:17.920
Please convey my apologies

382
27:17.960 --> 27:19.800
to all three of your friends, too.

383
27:20.160 --> 27:21.760
I'll get this sorted out as quickly as possible.

384
27:21.920 --> 27:24.600
Hearing you say that puts my mind at ease.

385
27:25.240 --> 27:26.400
Yes, thank you.

386
27:31.800 --> 27:32.520
Itt,

387
27:32.520 --> 27:33.880
I put you in charge of this project.

388
27:33.920 --> 27:35.560
Tell me what the hell happened.

389
27:37.960 --> 27:39.920
P'Ing, I didn't know anything about this.

390
27:39.920 --> 27:41.000
Oh, so you didn't know?

391
27:41.040 --> 27:42.640
Do you think that'll make it all go away?

392
27:42.760 --> 27:43.800
Let me ask you something.

393
27:43.800 --> 27:44.960
I trusted you with this.

394
27:44.960 --> 27:46.400
What the hell have you done?

395
27:48.400 --> 27:50.240
P'Ing, I didn't do it.

396
27:50.680 --> 27:51.600
You told me

397
27:51.640 --> 27:52.960
to have Pite help me, didn't you?

398
27:53.920 --> 27:56.160
After he handled Director Pha-nu's unit,

399
27:56.480 --> 27:59.200
he took the documents for the other three units with him.

400
27:59.240 --> 28:01.080
He said he could handle it on his own.

401
28:01.160 --> 28:03.200
Yeah, I told you to let him help,

402
28:03.200 --> 28:04.800
but I also told you to keep

403
28:04.800 --> 28:05.880
those sensitive documents safe.

404
28:06.560 --> 28:08.200
Why don't you ever listen to me?

405
28:08.240 --> 28:10.240
You're such a disappointment.

406
28:10.800 --> 28:12.720
I never should've let you intern here.

407
28:12.800 --> 28:14.520
I shouldn't have trusted you.

408
28:20.760 --> 28:21.360
P'Ing,

409
28:21.400 --> 28:23.320
I tried to stick with him the whole time.

410
28:24.360 --> 28:25.360
When he met the director and his friends,

411
28:25.360 --> 28:26.680
I was there, too.

412
28:26.760 --> 28:28.640
I thought he'd already completed the transfer.

413
28:28.680 --> 28:30.840
Yeah, he'd completed it.

414
28:31.040 --> 28:33.200
He gave those three people five million each.

415
28:33.240 --> 28:34.320
That's what he did.

416
28:34.320 --> 28:36.000
And then he pocketed my condo units for himself.

417
28:36.040 --> 28:37.240
He basically stole my money.

418
28:40.160 --> 28:41.280
Be honest with me.

419
28:42.560 --> 28:45.320
Did you and Pite plot to embezzle my money?

420
28:45.880 --> 28:48.520
P'Ing, I'm your brother.

421
28:48.520 --> 28:50.160
Why would I do something like that?

422
29:00.560 --> 29:01.440
Dammit.

423
29:01.760 --> 29:02.960
He turned off his phone on me.

424
29:07.440 --> 29:09.040
Hello, Ing?

425
29:10.160 --> 29:10.840
Auntie,

426
29:11.680 --> 29:12.600
where is Pite?

427
29:12.600 --> 29:14.080
I can't get ahold of him at all.

428
29:14.080 --> 29:15.400
Oh, Pite?

429
29:15.440 --> 29:17.880
He's visiting his uncle in Australia.

430
29:17.920 --> 29:19.680
He told me he won't be back for a year.

431
29:20.160 --> 29:21.040
Oh, is that so?

432
29:21.880 --> 29:23.840
Do you have a number where I can reach him?

433
29:23.880 --> 29:26.240
Yes, I do. Let me find it for you.

434
29:26.240 --> 29:27.720
Ing, don't you think...

435
29:27.760 --> 29:29.600
Pite looks way wealthier than before?

436
29:29.640 --> 29:31.600
He even bought his uncle

437
29:31.640 --> 29:33.240
a six-figure golf club set.

438
29:33.280 --> 29:35.080
Thank you so much, Ing,

439
29:35.120 --> 29:36.440
for mentoring him.

440
29:36.480 --> 29:37.360
I don't know

441
29:37.400 --> 29:39.080
what he'd do without you.

442
29:39.080 --> 29:41.880
I found the number. I'll send it over.

443
29:41.920 --> 29:42.600
Okay.

444
29:42.640 --> 29:43.920
Alright.

445
29:43.960 --> 29:44.840
Thank you.

446
29:46.000 --> 29:47.600
That jerk already fled to Australia.

447
29:48.320 --> 29:49.000
Itt,

448
29:49.040 --> 29:50.800
absolutely no one can know about this.

449
29:51.160 --> 29:51.840
If I ever find out

450
29:51.880 --> 29:53.240
that you were in on this with him,

451
29:53.280 --> 29:54.960
you're never setting foot in my house again.

452
29:56.520 --> 29:57.680
Get lost.

453
30:01.040 --> 30:02.080
I said get lost.

454
30:02.120 --> 30:03.600
What the hell are you crying for?

455
30:05.360 --> 30:07.800
Dammit, not a single one of you can do anything right.

456
30:16.000 --> 30:16.800
[Jelly (Junior)]

457
30:16.800 --> 30:18.920
[I'm all ready now.]

458
30:18.920 --> 30:21.640
[Are you free tonight, Mr. Ing?]

459
30:26.120 --> 30:26.640
[Score Sheet]

460
30:30.560 --> 30:31.960
I fought tooth and nail

461
30:32.000 --> 30:33.440
to get this tryout match back for you.

462
30:34.360 --> 30:36.040
You'd better make all my effort worth it.

463
30:37.400 --> 30:38.800
I won't let you down.

464
30:53.640 --> 30:54.720
It's good you came.

465
30:55.960 --> 30:57.640
I've had nothing but headaches lately.

466
31:02.960 --> 31:03.760
Come here.

467
31:19.600 --> 31:20.640
Whoa...

468
31:21.400 --> 31:23.200
You've made some progress, I see.

469
31:36.160 --> 31:36.800
I'm...

470
31:36.840 --> 31:38.320
I'm so sorry, Mr. Ing.

471
31:38.440 --> 31:40.640
It's just that... I don't have any experience.

472
31:45.160 --> 31:46.440
That part of yours...

473
31:47.400 --> 31:48.600
Is it alright?

474
31:49.440 --> 31:50.760
Stop staring down there.

475
31:52.440 --> 31:53.760
Whatever.

476
31:54.960 --> 31:56.080
Hand me a cigarette.

477
32:01.800 --> 32:02.600
Here you go.

478
32:04.960 --> 32:05.800
Where's the lighter?

479
32:06.440 --> 32:07.440
Isn't it right there?

480
32:08.440 --> 32:09.960
I'll buy one for you.

481
32:15.240 --> 32:16.040
What is it?

482
32:21.840 --> 32:23.160
If you can,

483
32:24.960 --> 32:26.440
please cut down on smoking.

484
32:27.640 --> 32:29.160
It's bad for your health.

485
32:39.040 --> 32:40.040
You're right.

486
32:41.640 --> 32:43.040
I guess I can cut down a little.

487
32:46.760 --> 32:47.760
Come sit here.

488
33:10.560 --> 33:12.160
You're a fast learner.

489
33:13.840 --> 33:17.120
I'll be looking forward to your progress next time.

490
33:19.920 --> 33:22.560
Thank you, Mr. Ing.

491
33:27.440 --> 33:28.160
Fight.

492
33:29.880 --> 33:30.960
Keep eye contact, kid.

493
33:34.240 --> 33:35.640
-Go. -Go, go, go.

494
33:36.240 --> 33:37.080
Come on.

495
33:38.000 --> 33:39.000
Start swinging.

496
33:39.040 --> 33:40.080
Yeah, that's it.

497
33:43.080 --> 33:44.280
I seriously don't like P'Ing.

498
33:44.280 --> 33:45.280
-I actually like... -That's enough.

499
33:45.320 --> 33:47.320
That face of yours doesn't just belong to you.

500
33:47.320 --> 33:49.120
It carries the name of the Sukonsiri family.

501
33:49.160 --> 33:50.720
If I don't get to be inside you in this life,

502
33:50.760 --> 33:51.960
don't ever call me Ing again.

503
33:54.880 --> 33:55.840
Now we're even.

504
33:55.880 --> 33:56.880
You won't be able to get me out of your head.

505
33:56.880 --> 33:58.080
Why don't you just go to hell?

506
34:04.240 --> 34:05.000
Go.

507
34:08.560 --> 34:10.159
-Hey. -Great. That's good.

508
34:13.280 --> 34:14.159
Go.

509
35:12.320 --> 35:13.560
Yes, P'Pha-nu.

510
35:13.600 --> 35:16.280
I've completed the transfer of three condo units

511
35:16.320 --> 35:17.960
in my new project.

512
35:19.520 --> 35:20.280
Yes.

513
35:20.560 --> 35:22.920
I'm really sorry for all the trouble this caused.

514
35:23.960 --> 35:26.360
Yes, thank you.

515
35:28.960 --> 35:30.480
Pite, you jerk.

516
35:33.480 --> 35:34.280
Come in.

517
35:51.120 --> 35:52.200
Regarding the agricultural development project

518
35:52.240 --> 35:53.640
you mentioned last time,

519
35:54.120 --> 35:56.560
P'Phet said the council was pleased with the proposal.

520
35:56.960 --> 35:58.360
He wants you to take the project manager

521
35:58.360 --> 35:59.600
on a site visit as well.

522
36:07.040 --> 36:08.400
We'll go next month.

523
36:12.160 --> 36:12.960
Yes, sir.

524
36:15.680 --> 36:16.480
By the way...

525
36:18.640 --> 36:20.400
how long has it been since you last came here?

526
36:21.960 --> 36:22.880
I don't remember.

527
36:23.280 --> 36:24.160
Why haven't you been coming in?

528
36:24.600 --> 36:25.600
Been busy with my studies.

529
36:29.680 --> 36:30.600
And...

530
36:34.960 --> 36:35.960
The boxing situation?

531
36:42.680 --> 36:43.880
It's been taken care of.

532
36:48.680 --> 36:49.600
Also...

533
36:54.800 --> 36:56.480
Try to come here more often

534
36:57.960 --> 36:59.320
because you're currently in possession

535
36:59.360 --> 37:00.560
of some important documents.

536
37:02.600 --> 37:03.760
If you don't want to do this anymore, say it.

537
37:04.800 --> 37:05.880
I'll find someone else to handle it.

538
37:08.920 --> 37:11.320
I'll come into the office at least once a week.

539
37:13.640 --> 37:14.400
But...

540
37:14.520 --> 37:15.640
I know.

541
37:22.160 --> 37:23.800
Arguing about it won't change anything.

542
37:27.280 --> 37:28.280
So...

543
37:29.880 --> 37:31.280
are you coming to Pattaya with me?

544
37:32.960 --> 37:33.680
Yes.

545
37:37.680 --> 37:39.280
Let's go grab some dinner tonight, then.

546
37:39.680 --> 37:40.560
I have other plans.

547
37:41.480 --> 37:42.800
It's just a meal.

548
37:43.280 --> 37:45.080
You have to eat dinner anyway, don't you?

549
37:50.480 --> 37:51.960
Fine, have it your way.

550
37:52.800 --> 37:53.880
Get back to work, then.

551
37:59.560 --> 38:01.960
Fine, don't eat then.

552
38:02.080 --> 38:03.480
You think I'm gonna beg you?

553
38:09.600 --> 38:11.200
Congratulations, Mr. Leo.

554
38:11.200 --> 38:12.120
Thanks, Ray.

555
38:12.120 --> 38:13.320
You actually made it.

556
38:13.480 --> 38:14.440
The place looks beautiful.

557
38:14.480 --> 38:15.480
-The vibe is amazing. -I know, right?

558
38:16.040 --> 38:16.920
Please support it.

559
38:16.960 --> 38:17.840
Will do.

560
38:18.320 --> 38:19.920
I'll head inside first, then.

561
38:19.920 --> 38:20.520
Sure thing.

562
38:20.560 --> 38:21.600
Take some photos for the review.

563
38:21.600 --> 38:22.440
You got it.

564
38:23.720 --> 38:26.240
-Hey. -What's up?

565
38:27.000 --> 38:28.320
Looking sharp today.

566
38:28.360 --> 38:30.560
Well, it's my grand opening today.

567
38:30.560 --> 38:33.080
You expect me to look like a kicked puppy?

568
38:33.520 --> 38:34.200
Come on.

569
38:34.800 --> 38:37.000
Lots of familiar faces here today.

570
38:37.440 --> 38:38.360
You bet.

571
38:38.360 --> 38:40.360
Most of them are friends coming to show support.

572
38:40.520 --> 38:41.640
It's just Win

573
38:41.680 --> 38:43.440
who's off taking his sweetheart on a trip abroad.

574
38:43.440 --> 38:45.280
When he gets back, let me know.

575
38:45.480 --> 38:47.000
I really want to see what his partner looks like.

576
38:47.040 --> 38:48.360
So do I.

577
38:49.800 --> 38:52.720
Wait, who's this? A new flame?

578
38:52.800 --> 38:55.000
He's quite the looker.

579
38:55.520 --> 38:56.920
This is Leo.

580
38:58.800 --> 39:00.400
Hello, Mr. Leo.

581
39:00.440 --> 39:01.960
Come on, there's no need for that.

582
39:02.120 --> 39:04.040
You can just call me P'Leo.

583
39:04.600 --> 39:05.160
Okay.

584
39:05.200 --> 39:06.280
Excuse me, Mit.

585
39:06.400 --> 39:08.680
Please look after these two guests.

586
39:08.720 --> 39:10.960
I'd like a VIP room for Mr. Ing here.

587
39:10.960 --> 39:12.080
Give him a private room.

588
39:12.520 --> 39:13.600
Please take good care of them.

589
39:14.440 --> 39:16.160
Just try not to wreck my room.

590
39:18.480 --> 39:19.640
I can't make any promises.

591
39:19.640 --> 39:21.760
If we happen to do so, sorry, buddy.

592
39:21.760 --> 39:23.360
I knew it.

593
39:23.360 --> 39:24.880
-Thanks, man. -See you.

594
39:24.880 --> 39:25.600
Yeah.

595
39:27.720 --> 39:28.640
Next time,

596
39:28.640 --> 39:29.920
I'll buy you a watch.

597
39:33.320 --> 39:34.720
Thank you, P'Ing.

598
39:35.240 --> 39:36.120
It's nothing.

599
39:36.720 --> 39:37.920
You deserve it.

600
39:57.840 --> 39:58.840
You should leave.

601
39:59.720 --> 40:01.520
Come on, go home. It's nothing.

602
40:01.840 --> 40:02.920
Go on.

603
40:06.400 --> 40:07.200
Yok.

604
40:08.400 --> 40:09.200
Hey.

605
40:10.920 --> 40:11.840
Yok.

606
40:13.120 --> 40:13.920
Hey.

607
40:19.640 --> 40:20.400
Yok.

608
40:20.720 --> 40:22.280
Yok, talk to me right now.

609
40:22.360 --> 40:23.200
Let go of me.

610
40:25.880 --> 40:28.880
Oh, so this was your other plan?

611
40:29.680 --> 40:30.360
Huh?

612
40:31.960 --> 40:33.880
P'Ing, what exactly do you want?

613
40:34.320 --> 40:36.320
Didn't you say there's no point in us arguing?

614
40:36.640 --> 40:38.040
Then why are you making such a scene?

615
40:39.840 --> 40:40.640
Oh...

616
40:45.360 --> 40:46.280
Are you jealous?

617
40:50.600 --> 40:51.360
Look.

618
40:53.880 --> 40:55.760
If you're jealous, just be honest and say it.

619
40:57.840 --> 40:58.920
It's nothing.

620
41:00.320 --> 41:01.520
I can explain, you know.

621
41:06.320 --> 41:07.120
Jealous?

622
41:07.640 --> 41:08.720
You're so full of yourself.

623
41:09.040 --> 41:10.400
You'll just sleep with anyone,

624
41:10.480 --> 41:12.080
and it disgusts me.

625
41:12.120 --> 41:13.200
What did you just say?

626
41:13.920 --> 41:15.400
You're disgusting.

627
41:16.320 --> 41:18.640
You literally took me first.

628
41:19.640 --> 41:20.720
You took me, didn't you?

629
41:25.520 --> 41:26.840
You punched me, huh?

630
41:26.840 --> 41:27.640
You punched me?

631
41:31.120 --> 41:32.120
You little jerk.

632
41:32.920 --> 41:34.400
You kicked me?

633
41:40.080 --> 41:40.960
Shoot.

634
41:42.400 --> 41:44.920
Why didn't you warn me first?

635
41:46.480 --> 41:48.360
Oh, it's already past midnight, Leo.

636
41:49.320 --> 41:51.400
My Cinderella time is up.

637
41:51.440 --> 41:52.480
I'm leaving.

638
41:57.120 --> 41:58.600
I'll take my leave.

639
42:03.360 --> 42:04.240
I'm here to apologize.

640
42:05.960 --> 42:06.840
Apologize?

641
42:06.880 --> 42:08.040
You're not backing out

642
42:09.080 --> 42:10.560
just because you fell for my brother, are you?

643
42:11.200 --> 42:11.920
P'Ing,

644
42:12.440 --> 42:13.680
we need to sort this out first.

645
42:15.400 --> 42:17.040
We're in public, you know.

646
42:21.520 --> 42:22.360
Yok.

647
42:23.480 --> 42:25.000
You said we'd watch the sunrise together, didn't you?

648
42:32.040 --> 42:33.080
P'Ing...
